ntegration for Security Exposure Management","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/security-management/ms-defender-sem.md","line":150},{"title":"Optimized Tenable.io Compliance Results ingestion","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/security-management/tenableIntegration.md","line":154},{"title":"Qualys Integration – API enhancements","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/security-management/c_QualysVulnIntegration.md","line":158},{"title":"GitHub Application Vulnerability Integration – Generic secrets support","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/security-management/github-vuln-integration.md","line":162},{"title":"ITSM Advanced plugin required for change request options in the Remediation view","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/security-management/sem-ws-CRs.md","line":169},{"title":"Create remediation tasks directly from the Security Exposure Management Workspace list view","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/security-management/sem-workspace-list-page.md","line":173},{"title":"Improved vulnerability assessment workflows","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/security-management/vr-ws-vuln-assessment.md","line":177},{"title":"Remediation task rule execution mode","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/security-management/sem-grouping-multiple-findings-remediation-tasks-processing.md","line":181},{"title":"Enhanced Compensatory controls","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/security-management/requesting-approving-risk-reduction.md","line":185},{"title":"ServiceNow Store","target":"https://store.servicenow.com/sn_appstore_store.do#!/store/home","line":192},{"title":"ServiceNow Store version history release notes","target":"https://www.servicenow.com/docs/bundle/store-release-notes/page/release-notes/store/sn-store-release-notes.html","line":192},{"title":"Security Operations release notes","target":"security-operations-rn-landing","line":194},{"title":"Security Operations release notes","target":"security-operations-rn-landing","line":198},{"title":"Upgrade to the Australia release","target":"upgrades-overview","line":199}],"metadata":{"title":"Unified Security Exposure Management \\(USEM\\) notes","description":"The ServiceNow Unified Security Exposure Management \\(USEM\\) application enhances exposure management with role-based views, enabling faster decision-making, efficient task handling, and streamlined approvals. It centralizes workflows, improves visibility across exposures, and enforces governance through configurable rules. With consistent navigation and integrated configuration, USEM boosts productivity, collaboration, and control across security operations, delivering a unified experience for exposures across assets. USEM was enhanced and updated in the Australia release.","locale":"en-US","release":"australia","topic_type":"reference","last_updated":"2026-06-11","reading_time_minutes":12,"keywords":["usem release notes"],"tags":["#release-notes","#changelog","#versions","#updates","#type-reference"]},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[],"key":"ServiceNowOfficialDocs/release-notes/release-notes/secops-sem-rn.md"},
